{"seq":3,"slug":"payment-compliance","title":"跨境支付合规","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ecommerce/ecommerce-payments/cross-border-payments/payment-compliance","wordCount":1456,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"跨境支付合规\">跨境支付合规</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>跨境电商支付涉及多个司法管辖区的法律法规，合规是业务落地的前提。从反洗钱（AML）到数据保护、从支付牌照到税务申报，合规要求因市场而异且持续变化。违规后果从罚款到业务关停不等，合规成本是跨境支付系统建设的重要组成部分。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    subgraph 反洗钱合规&#10;        A1[KYC - 客户身份识别]&#10;        A2[AML 交易监控]&#10;        A3[制裁名单筛查]&#10;        A4[可疑交易报告]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 数据保护&#10;        B1[GDPR - 欧盟]&#10;        B2[PIPL - 中国]&#10;        B3[LGPD - 巴西]&#10;        B4[数据本地化要求]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 支付监管&#10;        C1[支付牌照]&#10;        C2[外汇管制]&#10;        C3[税务合规]&#10;        C4[消费者保护]&#10;    end&#10;    A1 --&gt; D[合规管理体系]&#10;    B1 --&gt; D&#10;    C1 --&gt; D\">graph TB\n    subgraph 反洗钱合规\n        A1[KYC - 客户身份识别]\n        A2[AML 交易监控]\n        A3[制裁名单筛查]\n        A4[可疑交易报告]\n    end\n    subgraph 数据保护\n        B1[GDPR - 欧盟]\n        B2[PIPL - 中国]\n        B3[LGPD - 巴西]\n        B4[数据本地化要求]\n    end\n    subgraph 支付监管\n        C1[支付牌照]\n        C2[外汇管制]\n        C3[税务合规]\n        C4[消费者保护]\n    end\n    A1 --&gt; D[合规管理体系]\n    B1 --&gt; D\n    C1 --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>合规领域</th>\n<th>核心要求</th>\n<th>违规后果</th>\n<th>管理复杂度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>AML/KYC</td>\n<td>客户身份验证、交易监控</td>\n<td>重罚 + 刑事责任</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据保护</td>\n<td>数据最小化、跨境传输限制</td>\n<td>GDPR罚款可达全球营收4%</td>\n<td>高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>支付牌照</td>\n<td>持牌经营</td>\n<td>业务关停</td>\n<td>中-高</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>外汇管制</td>\n<td>资金跨境合规</td>\n<td>资金冻结</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>税务</td>\n<td>代扣代缴增值税/GST</td>\n<td>补税 + 罚金</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"反洗钱与-kyc-体系\">反洗钱与 KYC 体系</h2><p>反洗钱（Anti-Money Laundering）是全球支付行业的共同合规底线。FATF（金融行动特别工作组）制定了国际 AML 标准，各国据此制定本国法规。跨境电商支付平台需要在用户注册、交易过程和资金结算多个环节执行 AML 措施。</p>\n<p>KYC（Know Your Customer）分为三个层级：简化尽职调查（SDD，低风险客户）、标准尽职调查（CDD，所有客户）和增强尽职调查（EDD，高风险客户）。在线身份验证通常结合证件 OCR + 活体检测 + 数据库交叉比对完成。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface KYCProcess {&#10;  level: &#39;sdd&#39; | &#39;cdd&#39; | &#39;edd&#39;;&#10;  requiredDocuments: {&#10;    identity: (&#39;passport&#39; | &#39;national_id&#39; | &#39;drivers_license&#39;)[];&#10;    address: (&#39;utility_bill&#39; | &#39;bank_statement&#39; | &#39;government_letter&#39;)[];&#10;    business?: (&#39;registration_cert&#39; | &#39;articles&#39; | &#39;ubo_declaration&#39;)[];&#10;  };&#10;  verification: {&#10;    documentOCR: boolean;&#10;    livenessCheck: boolean;&#10;    facialMatch: boolean;&#10;    databaseCheck: (&#39;pep&#39; | &#39;sanctions&#39; | &#39;adverse_media&#39; | &#39;credit&#39;)[];&#10;    addressVerification: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;  riskFactors: {&#10;    countryRisk: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;    productRisk: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;    channelRisk: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;    customerRisk: &#39;low&#39; | &#39;medium&#39; | &#39;high&#39;;&#10;  };&#10;  ongoingMonitoring: {&#10;    transactionMonitoring: boolean;&#10;    periodicReview: string;&#10;    sanctionsScreeningFrequency: string;&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> KYCProcess</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  level</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sdd'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'cdd'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'edd'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  requiredDocuments</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    identity</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'passport'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'national_id'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'drivers_license'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    address</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'utility_bill'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'bank_statement'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'government_letter'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    business</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'registration_cert'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'articles'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'ubo_declaration'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  verification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    documentOCR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    livenessCheck</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    facialMatch</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    databaseCheck</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'pep'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'sanctions'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'adverse_media'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'credit'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    addressVerification</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  riskFactors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    countryRisk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    productRisk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    channelRisk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    customerRisk</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'low'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'medium'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'high'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  ongoingMonitoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    transactionMonitoring</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    periodicReview</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    sanctionsScreeningFrequency</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>制裁名单筛查是 AML 合规的硬性要求。每笔跨境交易的参与方（付款人、收款人、中间机构）都需要与 OFAC SDN 名单（美国）、EU Sanctions List（欧盟）、UN Sanctions List 等进行比对。名单更新频率从每日到每周不等，筛查系统需要处理名称模糊匹配（如音译差异、别名等）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KYC 等级</th>\n<th>触发条件</th>\n<th>验证深度</th>\n<th>完成时间</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>SDD</td>\n<td>低金额、低风险国家</td>\n<td>姓名+邮箱</td>\n<td>即时</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CDD</td>\n<td>标准交易</td>\n<td>证件+地址+制裁筛查</td>\n<td>1-3天</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EDD</td>\n<td>高金额、高风险国家、PEP</td>\n<td>全面+资金来源证明</td>\n<td>5-15天</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"数据保护与跨境传输\">数据保护与跨境传输</h2><p>跨境支付涉及大量个人数据的跨境传输——支付信息从消费者所在国传输到商户所在国的支付处理中心。GDPR（欧盟通用数据保护条例）、PIPL（中国个人信息保护法）和 LGPD（巴西数据保护法）对跨境数据传输设有严格限制。</p>\n<p>GDPR 允许的跨境传输机制包括：充分性认定（Adequacy Decision，欧盟认可的数据保护水平相当的国家）、标准合同条款（SCC）、有约束力的公司规则（BCR）。2023 年欧盟-美国数据隐私框架（DPF）恢复了欧盟到美国的数据传输合法通道。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface DataProtectionConfig {&#10;  regulations: {&#10;    gdpr: {&#10;      applicable: boolean;&#10;      dpo: string;&#10;      transferMechanism: &#39;adequacy&#39; | &#39;scc&#39; | &#39;bcr&#39; | &#39;derogation&#39;;&#10;      dataRetention: { purpose: string; periodDays: number }[];&#10;      dpia: { required: boolean; lastAssessment: string };&#10;    };&#10;    pipl: {&#10;      applicable: boolean;&#10;      securityAssessment: boolean;&#10;      localStorageRequired: boolean;&#10;      crossBorderApproval: boolean;&#10;    };&#10;    lgpd: {&#10;      applicable: boolean;&#10;      legalBasis: string;&#10;      dpoContact: string;&#10;    };&#10;  };&#10;  technicalMeasures: {&#10;    encryption: { atRest: string; inTransit: string };&#10;    pseudonymization: boolean;&#10;    accessControl: string;&#10;    auditLogging: boolean;&#10;    dataMinimization: boolean;&#10;  };&#10;  subjectRights: {&#10;    accessRequest: { sla: string; automated: boolean };&#10;    deletion: { sla: string; cascadeToProcessors: boolean };&#10;    portability: { format: string; deliveryMethod: string };&#10;  };&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DataProtectionConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  regulations</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    gdpr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      applicable</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> boolean</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      dpo</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">      transferMechanism</span><span style=\"color:#D